    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "speaker": "npc2",
      "lines": [
        "Not everything, sir."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('19');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "speaker": "npc3",
      "lines": [
        "You still have us!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('20');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "speaker": "npc2",
      "lines": [
        "Please, sir, have faith in us!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('21');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "speaker": "npc3",
      "lines": [
        "We've stuck with you through thick and thin..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('22');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "speaker": "npc2",
      "lines": [
        "Boss, you could learn to rely on us, even if just a little..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('23');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "speaker": "npc3",
      "lines": [
        "Could you have any doubt on our loyalty?"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('24');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "speaker": "npc3",
      "lines": [
        "Ever since you took us in when we were lowly children, with no home to go to..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('25');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "speaker": "npc3",
      "lines": [
        "You're truly family to us!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('26');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "speaker": "npc2",
      "lines": [
        "More than just our boss!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('27');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "speaker": "npc2",
      "lines": [
        "Although we don't agree with everything you do, we will stand by you no matter what."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('28');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "You two..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('29');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "I'm sorry..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('30');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "My crude ambitions have blinded me..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('31');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "You guys are more than family. We sh-"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('32');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Wha?! Mewtwo escaped out of my Master Ball!"
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('33');"
