        "q.dialogue.set_page('34');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "Perhaps my Master Ball was defective..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('35');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "But, more importantly, Mewtwo deemed me unworthy..."
      ],
      "input": [
        "q.dialogue.set_page('36');"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "lines": [
        "It's time I turned it around."
